cmd/bnc's tests load the whole compiler: ~7 s on the single VM, ~20 min of load under double-VM on the CI runner and ~30 min with its 184 tests -- most of a 45-min shard.  Double-VM adds ~no coverage of the driver over -int (the checker and IR builder it reaches run double-VM through their own packages).  Runs fully under -int / -comp-int / -comp.
